  "tests/fixtures/grafana/dashboards/rcn-lab-overview.json and rcn-lab1-snmp.json: captured from the lab's Grafana. Confirm neither was imported from grafana.com under terms that forbid redistribution",
  "tests/fixtures/ and docs/bootstrap-probe/configs/: captured device configurations. Keep only what fixtures need, sanitised (the publication check covers addresses and names, not licences)",
  "deploy/snmp_exporter/routing-modules.yml: the MIB-derived help text (reviewed: LicenseRef-MIB-derived)",
  "The licence files missing beside alpinejs-csp, codemirror and Bootstrap",
  "The history: no Cisco image, licence file, proprietary MIB or key was ever committed (NSOT_STAGE10_PLAN 8.2a); lab tooling names images the person supplies and ships none"
